\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces  Ensemble statistics for the held-out Duffing trajectories. The upper panel compares the time-dependent mean and one-standard-deviation interval of the stochastic numerical solver and the DDIM-generated ensemble. The lower panel compares their variances. The diffusion model reproduces the oscillatory mean response and the principal time dependence of the stochastic spread, including the initial variance growth and its subsequent modulation. }}{20}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:duffing_statistics}{{5}{20}{Ensemble statistics for the held-out Duffing trajectories. The upper panel compares the time-dependent mean and one-standard-deviation interval of the stochastic numerical solver and the DDIM-generated ensemble. The lower panel compares their variances. The diffusion model reproduces the oscillatory mean response and the principal time dependence of the stochastic spread, including the initial variance growth and its subsequent modulation}{figure.5}{}}
